EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm flattered you want to chat so
much, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But I've got some important things 
on my mind, so let's talk later,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Je suis très flatté que tu veuilles
autant parler avec moi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mais là ça va pas être possible, on
parlera un peu plus tard, d'accord{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}È sempre un piacere parlare
con te, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Solo che adesso vorrei stare un po'
da solo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}. A dopo!{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich find's ja toll, dass du so viel mit
mir reden magst, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber ich bin gerade beschäftigt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich muss überlegen, wo ich meine
Lakritze versteckt habe...{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bu kadar konuşmak istemen hoşuma
gitti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ama kafamda önemli
şeyler var;
sonra konuşalım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sai, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} non dobbiamo
per forza dirci tutto adesso.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Magari parliamo più tardi, OK?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ho un paio di grattacapi adesso.
Ti dispiace lasciarmi da solo
per un po', {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}You again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I've got a lot on my mind right now,
so I don't really feel like chatting,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡¿Otra vez tú, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tengo la cabeza ocupada ahora
mismo, así que no me apetece nada
ponerme a charlar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ancora tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Scusami, ma ho un po' di pensieri
per la testa adesso e non mi va
tanto di parlare,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Was ist denn schon wieder,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Wenn du aufhören würdest, mich
ständig zu stören, fiele mir vielleicht
ein, wo meine Schokolade ist!{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}
